      <Comment source="BioCyc">Acts on five of the six isomers of myo-inositol phosphate, all except myo-inositol 2-phosphate, but does not act on myo-inositol bearing more than one phosphate group. It also acts on adenosine 2&apos;-phosphate (but not the 3&apos;- or 5&apos;- phosphates), sn-glycerol 3-phosphate and glycerol 2-phosphate. Two isoforms are known |CITS: [9322233]|.</Comment>
